SUMMARY:Vladimir Putin takes power (Soviet Union / Russia)
DESCRIPTION:Vladimir Vladimirovich Putin is a Russian politician and former
  intelligence officer who has served as President of Russia since 2012\, h
 aving previously served from 2000 to 2008. Putin also served as Prime Mini
 ster of Russia from 1999 to 2000 and again from 2008 to 2012. He has been 
 described as the de facto leader of Russia since 1999.\n\nNew leader: Sovi
 et Union / Russia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vladimir_Putin\nT
 ext: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:New leader
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vladimir_Putin
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
