DESCRIPTION:Stjepan "Stipe" Mesić is a Croatian lawyer and politician who 
 served as the president of Croatia from 2000 to 2010. Before serving two f
 ive-year terms as president\, he was prime minister of SR Croatia (1990) a
 fter the first multi-party elections\, the last president of the Presidenc
