 trict of central Chechnya\, between the villages of Ulus-Kert and Selmenta
 uzen.\n\nConflict: Russia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_fo
 r_Height_776\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
