 well as 208 of 259 seats in the Senate. It was held concurrently with a re
 gional election in Andalusia.\n\nElection: Spain\nSource: https://en.wikip
 edia.org/wiki/2000_Spanish_general_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0
 )\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
