SUMMARY:2000–01 Azerbaijani parliamentary election
DESCRIPTION:Parliamentary elections were held in Azerbaijan on 5 November 2
 000\, although a re-run had to be held in 11 constituencies on 7 January 2
 001 due to "massive irregularities". In the lead-up to the election\, the 
 authoritarian Heydar Aliyev regime banned seven opposition parties from co
 ntesting the election.\n\nElection: Azerbaijan\nSource: https://en.wikiped
 ia.org/wiki/2000%E2%80%9301_Azerbaijani_parliamentary_election\nText: Wiki
 pedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Election
