SUMMARY:Assassination of Laurent-Désiré Kabila (DR Congo)
DESCRIPTION:On 16 January 2001\, Laurent-Désiré Kabila\, then-President o
 f the Democratic Republic of the Congo\, was assassinated in his office at
  the Palais de Marbre\, Kinshasa by Rashidi Mizele\, an 18-year-old bodygu
 ard who had fought as a child soldier (kadogo) in the First Congo War unde
 r Kabila's command.\n\nAssassination: DR Congo\nSource: https://en.wikiped
 ia.org/wiki/Assassination_of_Laurent-D%C3%A9sir%C3%A9_Kabila\nText: Wikipe
 dia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
