SUMMARY:George W. Bush takes power (United States)
DESCRIPTION:George Walker Bush is an American former politician\, businessm
 an\, and U.S. Air Force veteran who served as the 43rd president of the Un
 ited States from 2001 to 2009. A member of the Republican Party\, he serve
 d as the 46th governor of Texas from 1995 to 2000. He is the eldest son of
  George H. W. Bush\, the 41st president of the United States.\n\nNew leade
 r: United States\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/George_W._Bush\nTe
 xt: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
