SUMMARY:Treaty signed: Treaty of Nice (France)
DESCRIPTION:The Treaty of Nice reformed the institutional structure of the 
 European Union to withstand eastward expansion\, a task which was original
 ly intended to have been done by the Amsterdam Treaty\, but failed to be a
 ddressed at the time. It was signed by European leaders on 26 February 200
 1 and came into force on 1 February 2003.\n\nTreaty: France\nSource: https
 ://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Treaty_of_Nice\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, 
