DESCRIPTION:The federal popular initiative “Yes to Europe!” was a Swiss
  federal popular initiative launched in 1996 and submitted to a vote on 4 
 March 2001. It sought to open negotiations for Switzerland’s accession t
 o the European Union\, subject to a final decision by the people and the c
 antons. The Federal Council and Parliament recommended its rejection.\n\nR
 eferendum: Switzerland\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yes_to_Europ
