SUMMARY:2002 Tunisian constitutional referendum
DESCRIPTION:A constitutional referendum was held in Tunisia on 26 May 2002.
  The amendments to the constitution would abolish the three-term limit for
  incumbent presidents and raise the age limit of a sitting president from 
 70 to 75. A second parliamentary chamber was introduced.\n\nReferendum: Tu
 nisia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2002_Tunisian_constitutional_
