SUMMARY:APEC Mexico 2002
DESCRIPTION:APEC Mexico 2002 was a series of political meetings held around
  Mexico between the 21 member economies of the Asia-Pacific Economic Coope
 ration during 2002. Leaders from all member countries met from 26–27 Oct
 ober 2002 in Los Cabos. Counter-terrorism efforts were major topics on the
  agenda of APEC Mexico 2002.\n\nSummit: Mexico\nSource: https://en.wikiped
 ia.org/wiki/APEC_Mexico_2002\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jd
 pi.pages.dev).
