SUMMARY:2002 Austrian legislative election
DESCRIPTION:Early parliamentary elections were held in Austria on 24 Novemb
 er 2002\, after internal divisions in the Freedom Party of Austria (FPÖ) 
 culminating in the Knittelfeld Putsch led to the resignation of several le
 ading FPÖ members.\n\nElection: Austria\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org
 /wiki/2002_Austrian_legislative_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\,
