SUMMARY:2003 Slovenian privatisation referendum
DESCRIPTION:A referendum on privatisation was held in Slovenia on 19 Januar
 y 2003. Voters were asked whether Slovenian Railways should be kept as a s
 ingle company during the privatisation process and whether subscribers to 
 Telekom Slovenije should receive a rebate for the above market price fees 
 paid for cable TV prior to privatisation.\n\nReferendum: Slovenia\nSource:
  https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2003_Slovenian_privatisation_referendum\nTe
 xt: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
