 esult was a victory for the Union for Monaco alliance\, which won 21 of th
 e 24 seats in the National Council.\n\nElection: Monaco\nSource: https://e
 n.wikipedia.org/wiki/2003_Monegasque_general_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC
