DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20030216
SUMMARY:15 February 2003 Iraq War protests
DESCRIPTION:On 15 February 2003\, a coordinated day of protests was held ac
 ross the world in which people in more than 600 cities expressed oppositio
 n to the imminent Iraq War. It was part of a series of protests and politi
 cal events that had begun in 2002 and continued as the invasion\, war\, an
 d occupation took place.\n\nProtest: Iraq\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.or
 g/wiki/15_February_2003_Iraq_War_protests\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\
 , via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
