DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20030217
SUMMARY:2003 Cypriot presidential election (Cyprus)
DESCRIPTION:Presidential elections were held in Cyprus on 16 February 2003.
  The election campaign was dominated by the ongoing negotiations over the 
 Annan Plan for Cyprus. Incumbent President Glafcos Clerides was largely in
  favour of the plan\, while leading opposition candidate Tassos Papadopoul
 os wanted substantial amendments before he would accept it.\n\nElection: C
 yprus\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2003_Cypriot_presidential_ele
 ction\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Election
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2003_Cypriot_presidential_election
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
