 xtraordinary meeting). Council presidency: Greece.\n\nSummit: European Uni
 on\nSource: http://www.consilium.europa.eu/uedocs/cms_data/docs/pressdata/
 en/ec/74554.pdf\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev)
