 he newly elected 101 members of the 10th Riigikogu assembled at Toompea Ca
 stle in Tallinn within ten days of the election. Two opposing parties won 
 the most seats\, with both the Centre Party and Res Publica Party winning 
 28 seats in the Riigikogu.\n\nElection: Estonia\nSource: https://en.wikipe
