SUMMARY:2003 Maltese European Union membership referendum (Malta)
DESCRIPTION:A referendum on European Union membership was held in Malta on 
 8 March 2003. The result was 54% in favour. The subsequent April 2003 gene
 ral elections were won by the Nationalist Party\, which was in favour of E
 U membership\, the opposition Labour Party having opposed joining. Malta j
 oined the EU on 1 May 2004.\n\nReferendum: Malta\nSource: https://en.wikip
