DESCRIPTION:A constitutional referendum regarding the prince's powers was h
 eld in Liechtenstein on 14 March 2003. The referendum had two questions: a
  "Princely Initiative" and a "Constitution Peace Initiative". The first qu
 estion passed with 64.32% in favour and the second question was rejected b
 y 83.44% of voters.\n\nReferendum: Liechtenstein\nSource: https://en.wikip
