 president of Turkey since 2014. He previously served as the 25th prime min
 ister from 2003 to 2014 as part of the Justice and Development Party (AKP)
 \, which he co-founded in 2001. He also served as mayor of Istanbul from 1
 994 to 1998.\n\nNew leader: Turkey\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/
