 eral secretary of the Chinese Communist Party (CCP) from 2002 to 2012\, pr
 esident of China from 2003 to 2013\, chairman of the Party Central Militar
 y Commission (CMC) from 2004 to 2012 and chairman of the State Central Mil
 itary Commission from 2005 to 2013.\n\nNew leader: China\nSource: https://
