 Air Base on Terceira Island in the Azores\, Portugal\, between the heads o
 f government of the United States\, the United Kingdom\, Spain\, and Portu
 gal. President Bush was in the Azores for less than 4 hours. The summit la
 sted approximately one hour.\n\nSummit: Portugal\nSource: https://en.wikip
