DESCRIPTION:The 2003 invasion of Iraq was the first stage of the Iraq War. 
 The invasion began on 20 March 2003 and lasted just over one month\, inclu
 ding 26 days of major combat operations. The invasion was conducted by a U
 nited States–led coalition of mainly American\, British\, Australian\, a
 nd Polish troops.\n\nConflict: Iraq\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki
 /2003_invasion_of_Iraq\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pag
