SUMMARY:Battle of Umm Qasr (Iraq)
DESCRIPTION:The Battle of Umm Qasr was the first military confrontation in 
 the Iraq War. At the start of the war\, one of the first objectives was th
 e port of Umm Qasr. On 21 March 2003\, as allied forces advanced across So
 uthern Iraq\, an amphibious landing force captured the new port area of Um
 m Qasr.\n\nConflict: Iraq\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of
 _Umm_Qasr\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
