DESCRIPTION:The Battle of Basra lasted from 21 March to 6 April 2003 and wa
 s one of the first battles of the 2003 invasion of Iraq. The British 7 Arm
 oured Brigade fought their way into Iraq's second-largest city\, Basra\, o
 n 6 April coming under constant attack by the Iraqi Army 51st Division and
  Fedayeen Saddam\, while elements of the British Parachute Regiment cleare
 d…\n\nConflict: Iraq\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Ba
