 he Marines of Regimental Combat Team 1 passed through the city over the br
 idges and attacked north towards Baghdad.\n\nConflict: Iraq\nSource: https
 ://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Nasiriyah\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.
