 on 12 April 2003. The proposal was approved by 84% of voters\, with a vote
 r turnout of 46%. Hungary subsequently joined the EU on 1 May 2004.\n\nRef
 erendum: Hungary\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2003_Hungarian_Eur
