SUMMARY:Coup: 2003 São Tomé and Príncipe coup d'état
DESCRIPTION:A faction of the armed forces of São Tomé and Príncipe led b
 y Major Fernando "Cobó" Pereira overthrew the country's government in a b
 loodless coup d'état on 16 July 2003. It was São Tomé and Príncipe's s
 econd military coup following a similar revolt in 1995. The coup leaders c
 laimed the coup was a response to government corruption and growing povert
 y.\n\nCoup: São Tomé and Príncipe\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wik
 i/2003_S%C3%A3o_Tom%C3%A9_and_Pr%C3%ADncipe_coup_d%27%C3%A9tat\nText: Wiki
 pedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Coup
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2003_S%C3%A3o_Tom%C3%A9_and_Pr%C3%ADncipe
 _coup_d%27%C3%A9tat
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
