DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20030804
SUMMARY:2003 San Marino voting system referendum
DESCRIPTION:A referendum on the voting system was held in San Marino on 3 A
 ugust 2003. The proposed change would have reduced the number of preferent
 ial votes from three to one. Although it was approved by 80.72% of voters\
 , the number voting in favour (8\,755) did not pass the required quorum of
  32% of all registered voters (10\,105).\n\nReferendum: San Marino\nSource
 : https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2003_San_Marino_voting_system_referendum\n
 Text: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
