SUMMARY:Ilham Aliyev takes power (Azerbaijan)
DESCRIPTION:Ilham Heydar oghlu Aliyev is an Azerbaijani politician and stat
 esman who has been the fourth president of Azerbaijan since 2003. He is th
 e son of the previous president\, Heydar Aliyev\, and has led the New Azer
 baijan Party since 2005.\n\nNew leader: Azerbaijan\nSource: https://en.wik
 ipedia.org/wiki/Ilham_Aliyev\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jd
 pi.pages.dev).
