DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20030819
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20030820
SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: Canal Hotel bombing (Iraq)
DESCRIPTION:The Canal Hotel bombing was a suicide truck bombing in Baghdad\
 , Iraq\, during the afternoon of 19 August 2003. It killed 23 people\, inc
 luding the United Nations' (UN) Special Representative in Iraq Sérgio Vie
 ira de Mello\, and wounded over 100\, including human rights lawyer and po
 litical activist Amin Mekki Medani.\n\nCrisis: Iraq\nSource: https://en.wi
 kipedia.org/wiki/Canal_Hotel_bombing\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via
  PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Crisis
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Canal_Hotel_bombing
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
