DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20030915
SUMMARY:2003 Estonian European Union membership referendum
DESCRIPTION:A referendum took place on 14 September 2003 to decide whether 
 Estonia should join the European Union (EU). Just over two-thirds of voter
 s voted Yes and Estonia joined the EU on 1 May 2004.\n\nReferendum: Estoni
 a\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2003_Estonian_European_Union_memb
