DESCRIPTION:The 2003 Guinea-Bissau coup d'état was the bloodless military 
 coup that took place in Guinea-Bissau on 14 September 2003\, led by Genera
 l Veríssimo Correia Seabra against incumbent President Kumba Ialá.\n\nCo
 up: Guinea-Bissau\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2003_Guinea-Bissa
