DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20030915
SUMMARY:2003 Swedish euro referendum (Sweden)
DESCRIPTION:A non-binding referendum on introduction of the euro was held i
 n Sweden on 14 September 2003. The majority voted not to adopt the euro\, 
 and thus Sweden decided in 2003 not to adopt the euro for the time being. 
 Had they voted in favour\, the plan was that Sweden would have adopted the
  euro on 1 January 2006.\n\nReferendum: Sweden\nSource: https://en.wikiped
 ia.org/wiki/2003_Swedish_euro_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\,
  via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
