DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20030922
SUMMARY:2003 Slovenian Sunday shopping referendum
DESCRIPTION:A referendum on Sunday shopping was held in Slovenia on 21 Sept
 ember 2003. Voters were asked whether they approved of limiting shops to o
 pening on ten Sundays a year. The proposal was approved by 58% of voters\,
  although voter turnout was only 27.5%.\n\nReferendum: Slovenia\nSource: h
 ttps://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2003_Slovenian_Sunday_shopping_referendum\nTe
 xt: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
