DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20031020
SUMMARY:2003 Swiss federal election (Switzerland)
DESCRIPTION:Federal elections were held in Switzerland on 19 October 2003. 
 Although in Switzerland's political system\, in which all four major parti
 es form a coalition\, it is very difficult to achieve a change of governme
 nt\, this election produced an upset with the strong showing of the right-
 wing\, anti-European Union and anti-immigration Swiss People's Party.\n\nE
 lection: Switzerland\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2003_Swiss_fed
 eral_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
