DESCRIPTION:The February 2004 Moscow metro bombing occurred on 6 February 2
 004 when a male suicide bomber killed 41 people near Avtozavodskaya subway
  station on the Zamoskvoretskaya Line in Moscow. Up to 250 people were inj
 ured in the incident\, some of the more common injuries being broken bones
  and smoke inhalation.\n\nCrisis: Russia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org
