SUMMARY:Coup: 2004 Equatorial Guinea coup attempt
DESCRIPTION:The 2004 Equatorial Guinea coup attempt\, also known as the Won
 ga Coup\, failed to replace President Teodoro Obiang Nguema Mbasogo with e
 xiled opposition politician Severo Moto Nsá. Mercenaries organised by mai
 nly British financiers were arrested in Zimbabwe on 7 March 2004 before th
 ey could carry out the plot.\n\nCoup: Equatorial Guinea\nSource: https://e
 n.wikipedia.org/wiki/2004_Equatorial_Guinea_coup_attempt\nText: Wikipedia 
