DESCRIPTION:The 2004 Madrid train bombings were a series of coordinated\, n
 early simultaneous bombings against the Cercanías commuter train system o
 f Madrid\, Spain\, on the morning of 11 March 2004—three days before Spa
 in's general elections. The explosions killed 193 people and injured aroun
 d 2\,500.\n\nCrisis: Spain\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2004_Mad
