SUMMARY:2004 unrest in Kosovo
DESCRIPTION:On 17–18 March 2004\, violence erupted in Kosovo\, leaving hu
 ndreds wounded and at least 19 people dead. The unrest was precipitated by
  unsubstantiated reports in the Kosovo Albanian media which claimed that t
 hree Kosovo Albanian boys had drowned after being chased into the Ibar Riv
 er by a group of Kosovo Serbs.\n\nProtest: Kosovo\nSource: https://en.wiki
 pedia.org/wiki/2004_unrest_in_Kosovo\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via
  PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
