DESCRIPTION:Lawrence Gonzi is a Maltese politician\, retired Nationalist po
 litician and lawyer\, who served for twenty-five years in various critical
  roles in Maltese politics. Gonzi was Prime Minister of Malta from 2004 to
  2013\, and leader of the Nationalist Party.\n\nNew leader: Malta\nSource:
