SUMMARY:2004 Liechtenstein referendum
DESCRIPTION:A double referendum was held in Liechtenstein on 4 April 2004. 
 Voters were asked whether they approved of amending the law on compulsory 
 accident insurance\, which would abolish the government's contribution to 
 domestic accident insurance\, and funding a new building for the security 
 forces.\n\nReferendum: Liechtenstein\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wik
 i/2004_Liechtenstein_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP 
