SUMMARY:2004 Slovenian minority rights referendum
DESCRIPTION:A referendum on minority rights was held in Slovenia on 4 April
  2004. Voters were asked whether they approved government proposals to res
 tore basic rights to ethnic minorities who had been erased from the citize
 n registry in 1992. The proposal was rejected by 96% of voters\, with a vo
 ter turnout of 32%.\n\nReferendum: Slovenia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.
 org/wiki/2004_Slovenian_minority_rights_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY
