SUMMARY:Assassination of Abdel Aziz al-Rantisi (Palestine)
DESCRIPTION:On the evening of 17 April 2004\, the leader of Hamas in the Ga
 za Strip\, Abdel Aziz al-Rantisi\, aged 56\, was assassinated by missiles 
 fired by Israeli warplanes on the car he was traveling in. In addition two
  of his bodyguards were killed. The operation was considered part of a cam
 paign to eliminate the leaders of the groups fighting in the uprising.\n\n
 Assassination: Palestine\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Assassinat
