DESCRIPTION:Perry Gladstone Christie PC\, MP is a Bahamian former politicia
 n who served as prime minister of the Bahamas from 2002 to 2007 and from 2
 012 to 2017. He is the second longest-serving Bahamian elected parliamenta
 rian\, representing the Centreville constituency from 1977 to 2017. He is 
 also a former athlete.\n\nNew leader: Bahamas\nSource: https://en.wikipedi
