DESCRIPTION:A referendum on the electoral law was held in San Marino on 3 J
 uly 2005. Voters were asked four questions on changes to the electoral law
  and electoral system. Although all four were approved by a majority of th
 ose voting\, voter turnout was just 21.7%\, meaning that the quorum of 32%
  of registered voters (10\,143) was not achieved for any question.\n\nRefe
 rendum: San Marino\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2005_San_Marino_
 electoral_law_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.p
