DESCRIPTION:The 31st G8 summit was held on 6–8 July 2005 at the Gleneagle
 s Hotel in Auchterarder\, Scotland and hosted by Prime Minister Tony Blair
 . The locations of previous G8 summits to have been hosted by the UK inclu
 de: London \; and Birmingham (1998). It is the first G8 summit to be held 
 in Scotland.\n\nSummit: United Kingdom\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/w
