DESCRIPTION:A referendum on ratifying the proposed European Constitution wa
 s held in Luxembourg on 10 July 2005. The referendum was Luxembourg's firs
 t since 1937. On 28 June 2005 Parliament approved the constitution in adva
 nce of the referendum\, and although the referendum was consultative\, par
 liament agreed to abide by the results.\n\nReferendum: Luxembourg\nSource:
