SUMMARY:Natural disaster: Hurricane Katrina
DESCRIPTION:Hurricane Katrina was an extremely powerful and catastrophic tr
 opical cyclone that affected the Southeastern United States in late August
  2005\, particularly in and around the city of New Orleans. Katrina became
  the United States' costliest tropical cyclone\, with an estimated $125 bi
 llion in damages.\n\nCrisis: International\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.o
 rg/wiki/Hurricane_Katrina\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.
