DESCRIPTION:Parliamentary elections were held in Norway on 11 and 12 Septem
 ber 2005. The result was a victory for the opposition centre-left Red-Gree
 n Coalition\, which received 48.0% of the votes and won 87 out of 169 seat
 s\, dominated by the Labour Party's 61 seats.\n\nElection: Norway\nSource:
