DESCRIPTION:A federal election was held in Germany on 18 September 2005 to 
 elect the members of the 16th Bundestag. The snap election was called afte
 r the government's defeat in the North Rhine-Westphalia state election\, w
 hich caused them to intentionally lose a motion of confidence to trigger a
 n early federal election.\n\nElection: West Germany / Germany\nSource: htt
