DESCRIPTION:Parliamentary elections were held in Poland on 25 September 200
 5. All 460 members of the Sejm and 100 senators of the Senate were elected
 . The election resulted in a sweeping victory for two opposition parties: 
 the right-wing\, national-conservative Law and Justice (PiS) and the centr
 e-right\, liberal-conservative Civic Platform (PO).\n\nElection: Poland\nS
 ource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2005_Polish_parliamentary_election\nT
