SUMMARY:2005 Slovenian RTVS referendum
DESCRIPTION:A referendum on political control of Radiotelevizija Slovenija 
 was held in Slovenia on 25 September 2005. Voters were asked whether they 
 approved of increasing political control of the country's public broadcast
 er. The proposal was approved by 50.7% of voters\, although voter turnout 
 was only 30.7%.\n\nReferendum: Slovenia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/
 wiki/2005_Slovenian_RTVS_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via 
