DESCRIPTION:A national reconciliation referendum was held in Algeria on 29 
 September 2005. The referendum was held to vote on adopting the Charter fo
 r Peace and National Reconciliation which had been drawn up to try to brin
 g closure to the Algerian Civil War. The official results showed an overwh
 elming vote in favour amid a high turnout.\n\nReferendum: Algeria\nSource:
