DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20051009
SUMMARY:Earthquake: 2005 Kashmir earthquake (India)
DESCRIPTION:On 8 October 2005\, at 08:50:39 PKT\, a Mw 7.6 earthquake struc
 k the Azad Kashmir region in northern Pakistan. Its epicenter was located 
 in the tehsil of Patikka\, near the city of Muzaffarabad. It caused catast
 rophic damage and tens of thousands of fatalities across Azad Kashmir and 
 northwestern Jammu and Kashmir\, India.\n\nCrisis: India\nSource: https://
 en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2005_Kashmir_earthquake\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4
 .0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Crisis
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2005_Kashmir_earthquake
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
