SUMMARY:Jens Stoltenberg takes power (Norway)
DESCRIPTION:Jens Stoltenberg is a Norwegian politician who has served as th
 e minister of finance since 2025\, a position he previously held from 1996
  to 1997. A member of the Labour Party\, he also served as the prime minis
 ter of Norway from 2000 to 2001 and 2005 to 2013\, and secretary general o
 f NATO from 2014 to 2024.\n\nNew leader: Norway\nSource: https://en.wikipe
