DESCRIPTION:On 23 October 2005\, Brazil held a country-wide referendum on a
 rticle 35 of the Disarmament Statute to determine whether to approve or di
 sapprove the article\, which states in full\, "The sale of firearms and am
 munition is prohibited in the entire national territory\, except to those 
