  unable to stand for a third term. Lech Kaczyński defeated Donald Tusk to
  become President of Poland.\n\nElection: Poland\nSource: https://en.wikip
 edia.org/wiki/2005_Polish_presidential_election\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA
