DESCRIPTION:An election for the National Assembly for Wales was held on Thu
 rsday 3 May 2007 to elect members to the National Assembly for Wales. It w
 as the third general election. On the same day local elections in England 
 and Scotland\, as well as the Scottish Parliament election took place. Thi
 s election was preceded by the previous Assembly election in 2003.\n\nElec
