 ident of Romania from 2004 to 2014. Prior to his presidency\, Băsescu ser
 ved as Romanian minister of transport on multiple occasions between 1991 a
 nd 2000\, and as Mayor of Bucharest from 2000 to 2004. Additionally\, he w
 as elected as leader of the Democratic Party (PD) in 2001.\n\nNew leader: 
 Romania\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Traian_B%C4%83sescu\nText: 
