DESCRIPTION:Operation Achilles was a NATO operation\, part of the War in Af
 ghanistan. Its objective was to clear Helmand province of the Taliban. The
  operation began on March 6\, 2007. The offensive is the largest NATO-base
 d operation in Afghanistan to date.\n\nConflict: Afghanistan\nSource: http
 s://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Operation_Achilles\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.
