DESCRIPTION:The 33rd G8 summit was held at Kempinski Grand Hotel\, 6–8 Ju
 ne 2007. The summit took place in Heiligendamm\, Bad Doberan\, in the Nort
 hern German state of Mecklenburg-Vorpommern on the Baltic Coast. The locat
 ions of previous G7 / G8 summits to have been hosted by Germany include Bo
 nn\, Munich (1992)\, and Cologne (1999).\n\nSummit: Germany\nSource: https
 ://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/33rd_G8_summit\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, 
