SUMMARY:2007 Israeli presidential election
DESCRIPTION:Indirect presidential elections were held in Israel on 13 June 
 2007. The Knesset elected Shimon Peres\, a former Prime Minister and a mem
 ber of the Kadima party. His opponents were Reuven Rivlin\, a former Kness
 et speaker\, of the Likud Party\, and Colette Avital\, of the Labor party.
 \n\nElection: Israel\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2007_Israeli_p
