DESCRIPTION:Legislative elections were held in France on 10 June and 17 Jun
 e 2007 to elect the 13th National Assembly of the Fifth Republic\, a few w
 eeks after the presidential election run-off on 6 May. 7\,639 candidates s
 tood for 577 seats\, including France's overseas possessions.\n\nElection:
