SUMMARY:Premiership of Gordon Brown takes power (United Kingdom)
DESCRIPTION:James Gordon Brown is a British politician who served as Prime 
 Minister of the United Kingdom and Leader of the Labour Party from 2007 to
  2010. Previously\, he was Chancellor of the Exchequer from 1997 to 2007 u
 nder Tony Blair. Brown was Member of Parliament (MP) for Dunfermline East 
 from 1983 to 2005 and for Kirkcaldy and Cowdenbeath from 2005 to 2015.\n\n
 New leader: United Kingdom\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gordon_B
