DESCRIPTION:Željko Komšić is a Bosnian politician who has served as the 
 Croat member of the Presidency of Bosnia and Herzegovina since 2018\, havi
 ng served from 2006 to 2014 as well. Previously\, he was a member of the n
 ational House of Representatives from 2014 to 2018.\n\nNew leader: Bosnia 
 and Herzegovina\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C5%BDeljko_Kom%C5%
 A1i%C4%87\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
