DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20070708
SUMMARY:2007 Latvian security laws referendum
DESCRIPTION:A referendum on two proposed security laws was held in Latvia o
 n 7 July 2007\; the referendum had been called after the president refused
  to sign the laws\, claiming possible influence of oligarchs on Latvia's n
 ational security\, and after 212\,000 signatures had been collected\, meet
 ing the requirement of about 150\,000 signatures.\n\nReferendum: Latvia\nS
 ource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2007_Latvian_security_laws_referendum
 \nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
