DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20070716
SUMMARY:Armed conflict breaks out: Pakistan vs TTP
DESCRIPTION:UCDP records a civil conflict between Government of Pakistan an
 d TTP over control of the government\, starting 2007-07-15. This episode w
 as active in 19 years (2007–2025)\, 10 of them at war level (1\,000+ bat
 tle deaths a year) and was still active in the latest data.\n\nConflict: P
 akistan\nSource: https://ucdp.uu.se/conflict/404\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-S
 A 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
