DTSTAMP:20261030T060403Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20070722
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20070723
SUMMARY:2007 Turkish general election (Turkey)
DESCRIPTION:General elections were held in Turkey on 22 July 2007 to elect 
 550 members to the Grand National Assembly. Originally scheduled for Novem
 ber\, the elections were brought forward after parliament failed to elect 
 a new president to replace Ahmet Necdet Sezer.\n\nElection: Turkey\nSource
 : https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2007_Turkish_general_election\nText: Wikip
 edia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Election
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2007_Turkish_general_election
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
