DTSTAMP:20261030T060403Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20070814
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20070815
SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: Qahtaniyah bombings (Iraq)
DESCRIPTION:The Qahtaniyah bombings occurred on 14 August 2007\, when four 
 coordinated suicide car bomb attacks detonated in the Yazidi towns of Til 
 Ezer (al-Qahtaniyah) and Siba Sheikh Khidir (al-Jazirah)\, in northern Ira
 q.\n\nCrisis: Iraq\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Qahtaniyah_bombi
 ngs\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Crisis
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Qahtaniyah_bombings
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
