DTSTAMP:20261030T060403Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20070815
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20070816
SUMMARY:Saffron Revolution (Myanmar)
DESCRIPTION:The Saffron Revolution was a series of economic and political p
 rotests and demonstrations that took place during August\, September and O
 ctober 2007 in Myanmar. The protests were triggered by the decision of the
  national military government to remove subsidies on the sales prices of f
 uel.\n\nProtest: Myanmar\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saffron_Re
 volution\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Protest
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Saffron_Revolution
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
