DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20070829
SUMMARY:2007 Turkish presidential election (Turkey)
DESCRIPTION:The 2007 Turkish presidential election refers to two attempts t
 o elect the country's 11th president\, to succeed Ahmet Necdet Sezer. The 
 most likely candidate for president was Abdullah Gül.\n\nElection: Turkey
 \nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2007_Turkish_presidential_election
 \nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
