 y two seats from 31–29 to 33-27 after official recounts.\n\nElection: Ja
 maica\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2007_Jamaican_general_electio
 n\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
