DESCRIPTION:A constitutional referendum was held in Venezuela on 2 December
  2007 to amend 69 articles of the 1999 Constitution. President Hugo Cháve
 z and supporters claimed the changes were needed to initiate the transform
 ation into a socialist country\; opponents claimed the reforms would under
 mine democracy in the country.\n\nReferendum: Venezuela\nSource: https://e
 n.wikipedia.org/wiki/2007_Venezuelan_constitutional_referendum\nText: Wiki
