DESCRIPTION:The Battle of Musa Qala was a British-led military action in He
 lmand Province\, southern Afghanistan\, launched by the Afghan National Ar
 my and the International Security Assistance Force (ISAF) against the Tali
 ban on 7 December 2007. After three days of intense fighting\, the Taliban
  retreated into the mountains on 10 December.\n\nConflict: Afghanistan\nSo
