SUMMARY:Mikheil Saakashvili takes power (Georgia)
DESCRIPTION:Mikheil Saakashvili is a Georgian-Ukrainian politician. He was 
 the third president of Georgia for two consecutive terms from January 2004
  to November 2013\, with a break from November 2007 to January 2008 after 
 he stepped down following anti-government demonstrations and ahead of an e
 arly presidential election.\n\nNew leader: Georgia\nSource: https://en.wik
 ipedia.org/wiki/Mikheil_Saakashvili\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via 
 PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:New leader
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mikheil_Saakashvili
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
