SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: 2008 Danish embassy bombing in Islamabad (Pakista
 n)
DESCRIPTION:The 2008 Danish embassy bombing was an attack on the Danish emb
 assy in Islamabad\, Pakistan on 2 June 2008. The suspected suicide car bom
 bing in the parking lot of the embassy took place at around 12:10 pm (UTC+
 5)\, killing at least six and wounding many more. The Danish national secu
 rity intelligence agency PET concluded that al-Qaeda was behind the attack
 .\n\nCrisis: Pakistan\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2008_Danish_e
 mbassy_bombing_in_Islamabad\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdp
