SUMMARY:Terrorist attack: Akihabara massacre (Japan)
DESCRIPTION:The Akihabara massacre is a mass murder that took place on 8 Ju
 ne 2008 in the Akihabara shopping quarter in Chiyoda\, Tokyo\, Japan. The 
 perpetrator\, 25-year-old Tomohiro Katō of Susono\, Shizuoka\, drove into
  a crowd with a rented truck\, initially killing three people and injuring
  two.\n\nCrisis: Japan\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Akihabara_ma
 ssacre\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
