SUMMARY:2008 Slovenian regionalisation referendum
DESCRIPTION:A referendum on establishing thirteen provinces was held in Slo
 venia on 22 June 2008. While turnout was only 10.9% of registered voters\,
  voters in all but two of the thirteen proposed provinces approved the cha
 nge\, the exception being the Central Slovenia and Coastal–Karst provinc
 es.\n\nReferendum: Slovenia\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2008_Sl
 ovenian_regionalisation_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via P
 RP (jdpi.pages.dev).
CATEGORIES:Referendum
URL:https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2008_Slovenian_regionalisation_referendum
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
