DESCRIPTION:The Battle of the Kodori Valley was a military operation during
  the Russo-Georgian War in the Upper Kodori Valley of Abkhazia\, a breakaw
 ay region of Georgia. It was the only part of Abkhazia under Georgian cont
 rol before this military conflict.\n\nConflict: Georgia\nSource: https://e
 n.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_the_Kodori_Valley\nText: Wikipedia (CC BY-S
