SUMMARY:Natural disaster: Hurricane Gustav
DESCRIPTION:Hurricane Gustav was the second most destructive tropical cyclo
 ne of the 2008 Atlantic hurricane season. The seventh tropical cyclone\, t
 hird hurricane\, and second major hurricane of the season\, Gustav caused 
