DESCRIPTION:A legislative snap election for the National Council in Austria
  was held on 28 September 2008. The previous election was held on 1 Octobe
 r 2006. The election was caused by the withdrawal of Austrian People's Par
 ty leader Wilhelm Molterer from the governing grand coalition on 7 July 20
 08.\n\nElection: Austria\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Campaignin
