DESCRIPTION:On 14 December 2008\, Iraqi journalist Muntadhar al-Zaidi remov
 ed his shoes and threw them at then United States president George W. Bush
  during a joint press conference with Iraqi prime minister Nouri al-Maliki
  in Baghdad\, Iraq. Bush quickly ducked\, avoiding being hit by either sho
 e. The second shoe collided with a U.S. flag positioned behind Bush.\n\nPr
 otest: Iraq\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/George_W._Bush_shoe-thr
