DESCRIPTION:Barack Hussein Obama II is an American retired politician who s
 erved as the 44th president of the United States from 2009 to 2017. A memb
 er of the Democratic Party\, he was the first African American to serve as
  president. Obama represented Illinois in the United States Senate from 20
 05 to 2008 and served as an Illinois state senator from 1997 to 2004.\n\nN
 ew leader: United States\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barack_Oba
