SUMMARY:Battle: Maersk Alabama hijacking (United States)
DESCRIPTION:On 8 April 2009\, four pirates in the Somali Basin seized the D
 anish/U.S. cargo ship Maersk Alabama at a distance of 240 nautical miles s
 outheast of Eyl\, Somalia. The siege ended after a rescue effort by the Un
 ited States Navy on 12 April. At the time of the hijacking\, Maersk Alabam
 a was owned by the Danish shipping company Maersk Line.\n\nConflict: Unite
 d States\nSource: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maersk_Alabama_hijacking\n
 Text: Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
