SUMMARY:Gordon Bajnai takes power (Hungary)
DESCRIPTION:György Gordon Bajnai is a Hungarian entrepreneur and economist
 \, who served as the Prime Minister of Hungary from 2009 to 2010. Prior to
  that\, he functioned as Minister of Local Government and Regional Develop
 ment from 2007 to 2008\, then as Minister of National Development and Econ
