SUMMARY:2009 Vincentian constitutional referendum (Saint Vincent and the Gr
 enadines)
DESCRIPTION:A constitutional referendum was held in Saint Vincent and the G
 renadines on 25 November 2009. Voters were asked whether they approved of 
 a new constitution which would have replaced the constitution in force sin
 ce independence in 1979. The proposal was supported by only 43.13% of vote
 rs in the referendum\, well short of the required two-thirds threshold.\n\
 nReferendum: Saint Vincent and the Grenadines\nSource: https://en.wikipedi
 a.org/wiki/2009_Vincentian_constitutional_referendum\nText: Wikipedia (CC 
 BY-SA 4.0)\, via PRP (jdpi.pages.dev).
